{"version":1,"content":"<p>姜濤今天（15日）出席活動時表示，日常生活已習慣以人工智能（AI）作為小助手，藉此獲取美食推介。</p><p>他即場示範利用AI為MIRROR演唱會尋求意見，獲建議與隊友邱傲然（Tiger）合作呈現結合武打與演唱的音樂劇環節。</p><p>姜濤對此笑言：「我是被他打，我的武打技巧不太好。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T11:20:08.361031+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T10:32:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T14:57:46.160908+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T11:17:38.344702+00:00","content_hash":"4cb2adcf3d629133be1939e4838a016616519cda93cc25bb3d137033d1a15eca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}